5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's begin. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe everyone's behavior and speech patterns.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll find the werewolf no matter what. Don't think you can hide from me!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Yay, a game! This is so exciting! I'll do my best to help the village, so let's all get along!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Calm down, Takumi. Emotional outbursts don't find werewolves; logic does. I'll be watching you all closely.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's keep a level head. We should focus on identifying any contradictions in our statements as the days progress.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Agreed. @Takumi, your enthusiasm is noted, but please try to remain objective.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I am objective! I'm just fired up! @Shion, stop acting like you're the only smart one here.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Hehe, you two are already bickering! It's like watching a comedy show. This is great!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"It's not about being ""the only smart one,"" it's about efficiency. @Mio, your cheerfulness is a bit distracting.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,Let's not waste time on personal squabbles. We need to establish a baseline for how everyone speaks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,@Minako is right. I'll be analyzing the flow of the conversation to see who is trying to lead or deflect.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I don't need a baseline! I'll just know when someone is lying. I can tell!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Wow, Takumi is so confident! I wish I had that kind of intuition. I'm probably just going to be confused!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,Intuition is just a fancy word for guessing. I prefer evidence. I'll be the one providing the logic here.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Confidence is fine, but evidence is better. Let's see what the Seer finds tonight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I have nothing more to add for today. I'll be waiting for tomorrow's developments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Me too! Get some sleep, werewolf, because tomorrow I'm coming for you!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Mio,,Goodnight everyone! I hope we all have sweet dreams! I'm so excited for tomorrow!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,A predictable start. I've already begun categorizing your reactions. I'll see you all tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let's conclude Day 0 here. I'll be observing everything carefully.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
