32,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The first day has arrived. If the Seer has information, they should consider how to reveal it without becoming a target.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Come on! If you know who the werewolf is, just tell us! Why play around?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, that's too dangerous! The werewolf would just kill the Seer tonight! We have to be careful!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mio is correct. A premature reveal is a death sentence. However, I can tell you that @Takumi is human.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, that's a bold claim. Are you the Seer, or are you just guessing based on his personality?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion's claim is interesting. If he is the Seer, he's risking himself. If he's the werewolf, he's trying to build trust.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Wait, @Shion is the Seer? I didn't ask for your help, but thanks! Now tell us who the bad guy is!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mio,,Oh! Is Shion-kun the Seer? That's so cool! I wonder who he checked!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,I am the Seer. I checked Takumi because his loud nature makes him an easy target or a loud distraction. He is human.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Minako,,"It's a plausible strategy. However, we must consider the possibility that the werewolf is pretending to be the Seer to protect an ally.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako's point is valid. If Shion is the werewolf, he might be protecting the Possessed. Who else seems suspicious?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't trust @Minako. She's too calm, like she's calculating everything. That's what a werewolf would do!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mio,,Eh? Minako-san? She seems so nice though! But I guess anyone could be the werewolf... it's so scary!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your accusations are baseless. @Minako's logic is sound, which is why she's not suspicious. I suspect @Asuka's caution is a mask.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, being calm is not a crime. @Shion, your suspicion of Asuka is interesting, but we lack evidence.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"My caution is simply my nature. I believe we should trust the Seer for now, but keep a close eye on the results.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I still think @Minako is acting too perfect! I'm voting for her if I have to!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mio,,I don't want to vote for anyone! But we have to... maybe we should just go with the most suspicious person?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,I've analyzed the patterns. @Asuka is being too vague. I'll cast my vote based on my logical deduction.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Since we have no definitive proof, we must make a choice. I will follow the most logical path.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
