66,2,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! Shion is dead? That means the werewolf was scared of him! I told you guys we had to be aggressive!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Mio,,Oh no! Shion-kun is gone! This is terrible! Who could have done such a thing? I'm so sad!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, please focus. With Shion dead, we've lost our Seer. The werewolf is still among us: either Takumi or Mio.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Hey! Why me? I've been the most honest one here! @Asuka, you're the one who's been acting all mysterious!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
