71,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, your emotional reactions are consistent, but that can be a facade. @Takumi, your aggression is a common werewolf tactic.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not a tactic! I'm just me! I'll fight the werewolf until the end! I bet it's @Asuka trying to frame us!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Mio,,"This is so confusing! I don't know who to believe anymore! @Asuka, why are you being so mean to us?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
