75,2,4,talk,Takumi,,That's exactly what a werewolf would say! You're trying to sound smart just like Shion did! I'm voting for you!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Mio,,I... I think @Takumi is getting too angry. Maybe @Asuka is right about the logic? I'm so scared!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
